     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">:-) Ok. We will be. Thanks a lot! Also for your immediate response.</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>Am Montag, 22. Juli 2019 14:03:26 UTC+2 schrieb Stefan Th. Gries:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">&gt; Just to make sure, you would definitely advise against using residuals retrieved from a chisquare test?\n<br>I wouldn&#39;t go that far (and some of the association rules statistics\n<br>are in fact similar to the residuals) but of course they can become\n<br>quote inflated given the low expected frequencies and so a combination\n<br>of association rules statistics might help with filtering out\n<br>interesting things. You&#39;ll have to be creative ...\n<br></blockquote></div>"
    ]
